---ComputeEngineTargetDetails is a collection of details for creating a VM in a target Compute Engine project.
---@class gcp.vmmigration_v1.ComputeEngineTargetDetails
---@field project? string The Google Cloud target project ID or project name.
---@field enableVtpm? boolean Optional. Defines whether the instance has vTPM enabled.
---@field additionalLicenses? gcp.vmmigration_v1.StringList Additional licenses to assign to the VM.
---@field secureBoot? boolean Defines whether the instance has Secure Boot enabled. This can be set to true only if the VM boot option is EFI.
